namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Animated::setRotation(number value)
\brief Set rotation immediately.

Cancels scheduled rotation changes and preserves the spin rate. This is an immediate, chainable operation. It throws after wait() or andThen(); only operations with a duration can be part of a timed animation sequence.

\param value Angle in radians, clockwise positive.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see getRotation(), rotateTo(), setSpin()
*/
 }
